# Keep LF in the repository for text files.
#
# This matters concretely here: the Python scripts in .dsh/skills/*/scripts/ and
# tests/ carry `#!/usr/bin/env python3` shebangs, and a CRLF shebang line makes
# them unrunnable on Linux/macOS ("bad interpreter"). Normalising to LF on
# checkout also stops line-ending churn between platforms.
* text=auto
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.gitignore text eol=lf
*.gitattributes text eol=lf
